    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 321,
        "text": "Hi, everyone. Thanks for coming to this meeting about the new community garden. I'm Mark, and I'm the coordinator. We have a few things to discuss. First, the good news: the city has given us permission to use the empty land behind the library. But we can only start planting next month because the soil needs testing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "fd9660682b1eba33f942530f15702c45ee302a70df673a1c2745c028d1ae1c65",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 327,
        "sourceEnd": 399,
        "text": "That's great, but I'm worried about water. Can we use the library's tap?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "a0ef84ad9c8e5ca85743b158e9abd9a8e4767c9b55e659a5b2d4c357364ea778",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 405,
        "sourceEnd": 575,
        "text": "Good question. We might be able to, but the library manager said we should ask again next week. So for now, we can't rely on it. We may need to collect rainwater instead.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "a806d8498b6930c42e683f8149b63789a9ff2b15101e2f71c708280c6d90a624",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 581,
        "sourceEnd": 651,
        "text": "I see. And what about tools? I have some spare shovels I could donate.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "ccf81f010050b0ac33e6a2eb5885daca740da7511259e49c66e43afa64a2146b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 657,
        "sourceEnd": 763,
        "text": "That would be very helpful. Thank you. We also need seeds. Does anyone have contacts with a garden center?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1db33c49ced60421438896426d8e7ed9086a0bcafd319fbe09420013e20765b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 769,
        "sourceEnd": 845,
        "text": "My neighbour works at Green Gardens. She might be able to get us a discount.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "53ad99b4587e81ed4022adbb7634d18ee0b73097854cc63c40cbcf7d91700357",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 851,
        "sourceEnd": 878,
        "text": "Perfect. Could you ask her?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8c3a590f6c3c1f150099feb9c9e15e332711decf514d35f753c689040264af0c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 884,
        "sourceEnd": 912,
        "text": "Sure, I'll call her tonight.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "57706071c99bd3aa0006b3f749db20e22d4ec24ea9eef829b3d281ffbad1aaa1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 1037,
        "text": "Thanks. Now, about the schedule. We're planning to meet every Saturday morning from 9 to 11. Is that okay for everyone?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0e4a1d1041b6bd465fd33a43f7dd78101c4dae2d513736c3fc1399c27aee3fb0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1043,
        "sourceEnd": 1128,
        "text": "I can come, but I might be late sometimes because I take my son to football practice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5d95ef2fa64b9063142fdae81a3d700eb24812f76fee35ceb5e0e84e818bc236",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1134,
        "sourceEnd": 1214,
        "text": "No problem. We can be flexible. Also, we need to decide what to grow. Any ideas?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "e857053e5f15bdbd44c80cea458dec36c898275be20c09523cf5ca5d7370870a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1220,
        "sourceEnd": 1308,
        "text": "I think we should grow vegetables like tomatoes and carrots. They're easy for beginners.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "763fa12124b21789f3225e4237824d7106efcfd0526a1c2fcd62bf1925ccccf3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1314,
        "sourceEnd": 1419,
        "text": "I agree. But we should also plant some flowers to attract bees. That can help the vegetables grow better.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "5016e8d528692d5b87661547b8e5777a48c81e948c64f75a5c361a2dc9df0eeb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1425,
        "sourceEnd": 1465,
        "text": "That's a good point. So, we can do both.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "17543bc67c3d2084a53907a5dd5ec8bb30537e10fb8bccdc9db3a42ef624d4b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1471,
        "sourceEnd": 1532,
        "text": "Yes. Finally, we need a name for the garden. Any suggestions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "98a276d568f5a0f5e6c7d57502360a3cb2d6403cebc357aaecaa86d19962a2ad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1538,
        "sourceEnd": 1563,
        "text": "How about 'Green Corner'?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "d2afbadf1f7fc976a8f4faedc4588ae32b1be8d27f155537b877029ab49391da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1569,
        "sourceEnd": 1662,
        "text": "I like it. Let's vote on it next time. Okay, I think that's everything. Thanks for your time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "4bdc010577765236009159bb8b130a9d7bb56a1acaada4aed8ed7d268b4dcace",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1668,
        "sourceEnd": 1701,
        "text": "Thank you. See you next Saturday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "25a1cfe7cad56b014bed1bc3072a60af97ffa23accc9ef528742a68eeab42b00",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
